  "review_id": "d4d75528-8b6a-4b0a-8d97-64de27d293fb",
  "review_text": "This app used to be one of my favs but after the recent update I'm just thinking of not using it anymore. Most of the basic features are now premium - queue, repeat, order of playlist and back option. If they really want to milk their users they should make this app paid rather than keeping it for free but without any features for free users. I recommend users to use apps like YT Music, Amazon Music etc. becuz they offer lot more freedom unlike this \"free\" app. Oh all of this not mentioning ads.",
